    "autonima": "excluded_fulltext",
    "reason": "Task-based fMRI of instructed reappraisal and selective attention to emotional film clips, with passive-viewing and regulation contrasts (I1-I5 met). However, the analyses were restricted to an explicit PFC/anterior cingulate/amygdala mask, so whole-brain evidence is not demonstrated (I6 not_met; E2 met)."
   },
